    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/af759488cbb8b3c695b284a357aa30bc.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Card Battler</h2>Mindbug distills all the excitement of strategy card games and transforms it into the most streamlined card battler of the multiverse.<br>Accessible and fair, yet extremely challenging and deep. Mindbug is a skill-based dueling card game that feels utterly different from all the other card games you've played before.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/035622050999127588b3a9ffa0d0d1cd.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience Meets Innovation</h2>With Richard Garfield (Creator of Magic: The Gathering) as one of the designers, this game has been designed with more than 30 years of card game experience and combined with a groundbreaking and innovative new game mechanic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/dd397a59a5ed8a6b70ce8d23cee421eb.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crazy Card Abilities \u2013 OMG this is OP</h2>In Mindbug, each card is insanely powerful. There are no weak cards, and it feels like all your options are completely overpowered. Every single decision in this game matters. Turn the tables with a single move. It\u2019s all up to you and your skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/8f472271e850c0cbfe1ff84e7e0c38e2.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast and Intense Matches</h2>A game of Mindbug can be played in less than 5 minutes, making it perfect for when you have a few minutes to spare. But don\u2019t be fooled by its quickness \u2013 the strategic depth will blow your mind. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/52befb2b83d30c3f85b82ccb95a8ddec.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Strategies</h2>Even though Mindbug is extremely easy to learn, the game will keep surprising you with new and exciting challenges and combos. The unique Mindbug mechanic allows you to control your opponents\u2019 creatures and leads to unique decision-making that requires even veteran card game players to adjust their traditional playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/15959fd308e8a55014f0263c161b7ca8.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not a collectible card game \u2013 No Pay to win! </h2>Mindbug is not a trading card game. There are no loot boxes, no random cards, and no pay-to-win. If you buy a card set, you can play with it as much as you want. <br><br>What are you waiting for earthling? Show your incredible skill and turn your opponents\u2019 strongest creatures into your own advantage! Play Mindbug Online Now!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/af759488cbb8b3c695b284a357aa30bc.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Card Battler</h2>Mindbug distills all the excitement of strategy card games and transforms it into the most streamlined card battler of the multiverse.<br>Accessible and fair, yet extremely challenging and deep. Mindbug is a skill-based dueling card game that feels utterly different from all the other card games you've played before.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/035622050999127588b3a9ffa0d0d1cd.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience Meets Innovation</h2>With Richard Garfield (Creator of Magic: The Gathering) as one of the designers, this game has been designed with more than 30 years of card game experience and combined with a groundbreaking and innovative new game mechanic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/dd397a59a5ed8a6b70ce8d23cee421eb.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crazy Card Abilities \u2013 OMG this is OP</h2>In Mindbug, each card is insanely powerful. There are no weak cards, and it feels like all your options are completely overpowered. Every single decision in this game matters. Turn the tables with a single move. It\u2019s all up to you and your skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/8f472271e850c0cbfe1ff84e7e0c38e2.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast and Intense Matches</h2>A game of Mindbug can be played in less than 5 minutes, making it perfect for when you have a few minutes to spare. But don\u2019t be fooled by its quickness \u2013 the strategic depth will blow your mind. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/52befb2b83d30c3f85b82ccb95a8ddec.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Strategies</h2>Even though Mindbug is extremely easy to learn, the game will keep surprising you with new and exciting challenges and combos. The unique Mindbug mechanic allows you to control your opponents\u2019 creatures and leads to unique decision-making that requires even veteran card game players to adjust their traditional playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351660/extras/15959fd308e8a55014f0263c161b7ca8.avif?t=1747060087\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not a collectible card game \u2013 No Pay to win! </h2>Mindbug is not a trading card game. There are no loot boxes, no random cards, and no pay-to-win. If you buy a card set, you can play with it as much as you want. <br><br>What are you waiting for earthling? Show your incredible skill and turn your opponents\u2019 strongest creatures into your own advantage! Play Mindbug Online Now!",
    "short_description": "Mindbug is the most streamlined card battler of the multiverse. Accessible and fair, yet challenging and deep. Engage in fast-paced card duels, unleash overpowered creatures, and outsmart opponents with innovative mechanics co-designed by Richard Garfield.",
